.TH CDIR 1 "2024-01-15" "ctools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cdir \- list agents and sessions from LLM context windows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cdir
.RB [ \-t ]
.RB [ \-s ]
.RB [ \-r ]
.RB [ \-R ]
.RB [ \-l ]
.RB [ \-o
.IR fields ]
.RB [ \-f
.IR format ]
.RI [ path ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cdir
(context directory) lists agents and their conversation sessions,
similar to DOS mtools but for LLM context windows.
.PP
The tool reads session metadata from agent storage directories
and presents them in a human-readable or machine-parseable format.
It can also export individual sessions as conversation JSON.
.PP
Without arguments, cdir lists all known agents and their storage paths.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-time
Sort sessions by modification time (default).
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-size
Sort sessions by size.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-reverse
Reverse the sort order.
.TP
.BR \-R ", " \-\-recursive
Show agent name in session list. When used without a path,
recurse all agents and show all sessions with agent prefix.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-long
Show full details: last-modified date, size, message count, and
source path. The creation date is suppressed. Equivalent to
.BR "\-o id,name,mtime,size,msgs,path" .
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output
.I fields
Select output fields, ps-style. \fIfields\fP is a comma-separated
list of field names. Pass
.B help
to list all fields with descriptions. Available fields:
.RS
.TP
.B id
Session identifier.
.TP
.B name
Session title (or ID prefix when no title is set).
.TP
.B ctime
Creation / start time.
.TP
.B mtime
Last modification time.
.TP
.B size
Size: token count for opencode, bytes for file-based agents.
.TP
.B msgs
Number of messages in the session.
.TP
.B model
Model used for the session.
.TP
.B path
Session working directory (where the conversation's code lives).
.TP
.B parent
Parent session ID (present on subagent sessions).
.RE
.PP
Default fields are
.BR id,name .
The path, when selected, is placed at the end of each row.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format
.I format
Set output format. Available formats:
.RS
.TP
.B default
Human-readable aligned columns.
.TP
.B json
JSON array of session objects.
.TP
.B xml
XML document with session elements.
.TP
.B md
Markdown table.
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I path
Agent name or agent/session_id path.
Without argument, lists all known agents.
With agent name (e.g., \fBopencode/\fR), lists sessions.
With agent/session_id (e.g., \fBopencode/ses_abc123\fR), exports session.
.SH EXAMPLES
List all known agents:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ cdir
Found:
  AGENT         DESCRIPTION                 PATH
  Claude Code   Claude Code CLI             ~/.claude/projects/
  Opencode      Opencode CLI                ~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db

Not Found:
  Claude        Claude Desktop (Anthropic)  ~/.config/Claude/conversations/
  Codex         OpenAI Codex CLI            ~/.codex/sessions/
  Pi            Pi Coding Agent            ~/.pi/agent/sessions/
.fi
.RE
.PP
Found agents show their actual files. Not Found agents show the expected path.
.PP
List sessions for opencode:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ cdir opencode/
  Source: /home/user/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db

  ID            NAME
  ses_abc123    Python Help
  ses_def456    Code Review

  2 session(s)
.fi
.RE
.PP
List sessions with full details:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ cdir -l opencode/
  Source: /home/user/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db

  ID            NAME          MODIFIED            SIZE    MSGS  PATH
  ses_abc123    Python Help   2024-01-15 10:30   2.4 KB     12  /home/user/src/project
  ses_def456    Code Review   2024-01-16 09:00   1.2 KB      8  /home/user/src/project

  2 session(s)
.fi
.RE
.PP
The PATH column is the session's working directory, not the storage file.
Select specific columns with
.BR \-o :
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ cdir -o id,model,path opencode/
  Source: /home/user/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db

  ID            MODEL        PATH
  ses_abc123    big-pickle   /home/user/src/project
.fi
.RE
.PP
List all sessions across all agents:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ cdir -R
  ID                      NAME          MODIFIED            SIZE    MSGS  PATH
  opencode/ses_abc123     Python Help   2024-01-15 10:30   2.4 KB     12  /home/user/src/project
  claude-code/ses_xyz     Bug Fix       2024-01-15 11:00   3.1 KB     20  /home/user/.claude/projects/my-project/ses_xyz.jsonl

  2 session(s)
.fi
.RE
.PP
Export a session as JSON:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ cdir opencode/ses_abc123
[
  {"role": "user", "content": "Hello"},
  {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi there!"}
]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Export a session as Markdown:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ cdir --format md opencode/ses_abc123
# Session — opencode/ses_abc123

## You

Hello

## Assistant

Hi there!
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db
OpenCode SQLite database.
.TP
.I ~/.claude/projects/**/*.jsonl
Claude Code session files.
.TP
.I ~/.pi/agent/sessions/**/*.jsonl
Pi Coding Agent session files.
.TP
.I ~/Library/Application Support/Claude-3p/
Claude Desktop session directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ccopy (1),
.BR cgrep (1),
.BR cdu (1)
.SH AUTHORS
ctools project.
